   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Which of the following equations would represent the chemical, <span data-math=\"C\">C</span>, after time, <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>, from the graph?</li>\n  </ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1333813,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"C = 1000+ \\frac{4}{5}+x\">C = 1000+ \\frac{4}{5}+x</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1333814,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"C = 1000(\\frac{4}{5})^x\">C = 1000(\\frac{4}{5})^x</span>"
    },
